        "text": "Only memory and state need to move",
        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right. The disk stays put."
      },
      {
        "text": "Local disks cannot hold VMs",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "local-lvm does."
      },
      {
        "text": "It avoids the subscription",
